---
import { Search } from '@lucide/astro';
---

<section id="explore" class="section section--teal" aria-labelledby="explore-title">
	<div class="section-heading">
		<div>
			<div class="eyebrow eyebrow--black">
				<span>EXPLORE ENGINE</span>
			</div>
			<h2 id="explore-title" class="section-title-two-tone">
				<span class="title-black">EXPLORE</span>
				<span class="title-yellow">INDEX</span>
			</h2>
		</div>
		<p>Prompt、Skill、MCP、网站与项目会在这里被搜索、筛选和重新发现。</p>
	</div>
	<div class="explore-preview" aria-hidden="true">
		<div class="explore-search-bar">
			<span class="search-icon-box"><Search size={22} strokeWidth={3} /></span>
			<span class="explore-input-mock">搜索花园中的条目（Prompt / Skill / MCP / 网站 / 项目）...</span>
			<span class="explore-kbd">即将开放</span>
		</div>
		<div class="explore-tags-mock">
			<span class="mock-tag mock-tag--active">ALL 全部</span>
			<span class="mock-tag mock-tag--red">PROMPT</span>
			<span class="mock-tag mock-tag--active">SKILL</span>
			<span class="mock-tag mock-tag--teal">MCP</span>
			<span class="mock-tag mock-tag--mint">WEBSITE</span>
			<span class="mock-tag mock-tag--coral">PROJECT</span>
		</div>
	</div>
	<div class="empty-state explore-status">
		<strong>探索实验室筹备中</strong>
		<p>第一批真实内容入园后，这里将开启实时检索、多维标签筛选与大卡片弹窗交互。</p>
	</div>
</section>
